window.products.push({"id":1134504,"name":"Jura-Capresso Café Pump Espresso & Cappuccino Machine, Black/Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gmnfthr+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Capresso - Espresso and Cappuccino Machine Perfect high-pressure brewed espressos Space saving state-of-the-art pump espresso & cappuccino machine with a ThermoBlock and continuous steam output, no downtime, no purging. This device is easy use and performs very well. There are two parts of the frother. There is a Frothing Sleeve for cappuccinos and when the Frothing Sleeve is removed, it reveals the Steam Tube for lattes. Frothing: Frothing Sleeve is in place over the steam tube. Hot steam and air are injected into the milk. The air will swirl inside the milk creating silky dense froth on top of the milk, ideal for a cappuccino. Steaming only: Frothing Sleeve is removed to reveal the Steam Tube. Only hot steam will be injected into the milk. This is ideal for a latte. Important: To work properly, the Frothing Sleeve and Steam Tube need to be free of any milk deposits from earlier use. State of the Art Features and Benefits Removable 48 oz. water container (35 espressos) for easy filling with self-locking valve Removable 48 oz. water container (35 espressos) for easy filling with self-locking valve Self-locking filter holder with thumbguard Self-locking filter holder with thumbguard Two Sieves to produce one or two rich, thick crema espressos at a time Two Sieves to produce one or two rich, thick crema espressos at a time Selector switch for espresso/cappuccino or steam/hot water functions Selector switch for espresso/cappuccino or steam/hot water functions Unlimited steam output produces hot frothed milk for cappuccino and latte Unlimited steam output produces hot frothed milk for cappuccino and latte Easy-to-use swivel frother allows you to froth directly in a tall glass or frothing pitcher Easy-to-use swivel frother allows you to froth directly in a tall glass or frothing pitcher Hot water switch allows you to produce teas or cafe americanos Hot water switch allows you to produce teas or cafe americanos Easy to clean removable drip tray with water level indicator Easy to clean removable drip tray with water level indicator Indicator lights for \"Warm Up\" and \"Ready\" Indicator lights for \"Warm Up\" and \"Ready\" Integrated metal cup warming platform Integrated metal cup warming platform Concealed spare sieve storage compartmen Concealed spare sieve storage compartmen Cord storage Cord storage One year limited warranty One year limited warranty Controls","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gmnfthr+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jura-Capresso","source_asin":"B005ZX82XE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1134504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005ZX82XE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005ZX82XE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
