window.products.push({"id":1134527,"name":"welltop Personalized Flannel Blanket to My Dad Gift from Daughter, Ultra Soft Flannel Fleece Blankets Father's Day Thanksgiving Christmas Birthday Coz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xNUOiQBHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Letter】 --- To my dad - for all the times that I forgot to - \"thank you\" - for all the special, little things you do, for all the words that sometimes go unspoken I need to say \"I love you, dad...I do.\" I love you for the way you stop and listen, and for your support throughout the years, for teaching me the meaning of compassion, and sharing in my triumphs and my tears. And if at times, I may have seemed ungrateful. I want to say \"I truly hope you see, that nothing you have done has been forgotten, and day by day, you mean more to me\" - love, your daughter 【High Quality】 --- Made of 100% microfiber polyester, this personalized throw blanket is soft, fluffy, comfortable and lightweight, good touch and friendly to your skin. Our Blanket with excellent color printing and clear image and text will not fade, and large size (59x79in) make sure the maximum space to wrap you warmly. 【Personalized Blanket】 --- This personalized flannel blankets with a letter has a special meaning, every word is full of the daughter’s love for her father. Expressing your love by these words can give your father warmth, let him feel your true love. 【Widely Application】--- The flannel fleece blanket is suitable for indoor and outdoor use, perfect to sofa, bedroom, living room, car, outdoor travel, camping or anywhere you need. Our throw blanket can make you stay snuggle warm. 【Perfect Gift】---This personalized blanket is written with loving text. Your father will full of warmth and surprise when receives this gift, helping to make your relationship warm up, ideal as a gift for Father's day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Halloween, Birthday, Easter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xNUOiQBHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welltop","source_asin":"B0BRX9M5SC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1134527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRX9M5SC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRX9M5SC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
