window.products.push({"id":1134562,"name":"Premium Memory Foam Cervical Roll Bolster Round Pillow for the Neck, Chin, Lumbar Spine & Leg Support Bendable Roll Pillow use for Traveling with Remo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BuL+QMbcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Rhythms of Wellness is created by the necessity of the people about a high quality memory foam cervical roll support to avoid the serious cervical, back and knee pain due to years of bending over in a wrong position at the work place or at home. We decided to create this ergonomic and multi-use neck roll support pillow to bring our comfort to everyone! The Rhythms of Wellness Premium memory foam cervical roll is made by high-density memory foam with a white inner jersey fabric cover. Our cervical-roll is the perfect accessory for your neck, back or legs to release the stress of the daily life or to enjoy your travel experiences with a very relax experience! Dark gray velvet cover easy to wash and NO Chemical Smell and Odor at all. The Rhythms of Wellness Memory Foam cervical neck Roll Bolster is the perfect combination of our ergonomic function to rest our cervical and lumbar lordotic curve of your spine! The Rhythms of Wellness cervical roll bolster support has button snaps to form a U-shape for your conform when you used as a cervical roll travel pillow or just want to rest your head in the couch. Therapeutic design to optimized firmness and provides enough support. It is a little bit firm, but not too firm or not too soft, just strong enough support for pressure points in the right areas to relief tension with the rebound effect of a high density memory foam to mold the body. Special features: Measures 4.25\" diameter x 26\" length Bendable in any position No metal or plastic spine core inside to make shape in different positions Zippered Cover for machine washing Allows perfect SUPPORT in any position Materials: High-Density Memory Foam; Outer Cover: Velvet; Inner Cover: 100% Cotton Jersey Fabric","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BuL+QMbcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rhythms of Wellness","source_asin":"B07GCX2C2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1134562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GCX2C2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GCX2C2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
