window.products.push({"id":1134626,"name":"Lily's Home Vintage Mantle Clock. Silent, Non Ticking Stylish Decorative Table Clock Perfect for Living Room, Retro Kitchen, Tabeltop & Fireplace Mant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o8uVnSoML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Although we are in the age of technology, it is nice to have a variety of decor styles that throwback to a time more rustic and old fashioned, in the best way possible. This clock has a classy yet antique look that will bring a touch of style to any space of your home, office, or classroom. You’ve never seen a clock just like this one! With a unique style, this clock will get compliments wherever it is being used. Its base has an antique design and is thick and sturdy but not extremely heavy. The upper part of the clock looks like a globe with bicycle spokes that meet in the center of the clock face. To make your clock easy to read, it includes the 12, 9, 6, and 3 in large numerals. The entire clock has an antique look in a dark brown color. The hands of the clock are black, making it easier to read from across the room. No matter where you put your new clock, it will fit right in with your current decor. Place it on a table, desk, nightstand, or end table in any room of your home. Whether you use it in your kitchen, living room, bedroom, office, or entryway, it will be a great addition to your decor. Ditch annoying wall clocks that are unreliable and that can be a pain to mount. With this clock, you simply place it on a flat surface and the sturdy base will keep it in place. The clock is battery operated and only needs a single AA battery to run. Relying on quartz movement, the clock provides accurate and precise timekeeping to save you from being late. This elegant clock makes a great gift for friends and loved ones. While it does have a rustic style and country flair, the clock looks great with minimalistic and modern design aesthetics too. Get this amazing steel clock today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o8uVnSoML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lily's Home","source_asin":"B09B37TBY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1134626","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B37TBY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B37TBY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
