window.products.push({"id":1134761,"name":"EFUSVAC Corded Vacuum Cleaner, 12KPa Powerful Suction with 400W Motor, 4 in 1 Lightweight Handheld Stick Vacuum for Pet Hair Hard Floor and Carpet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616r2B7QRjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4-In-1 Multifunction Cleaner】: The lightweight vacuum cleaner can efficiently and thoroughly clear debris, dust, crumbs, reducing hair entanglement. With a motorized cleaner head, dusting brush, crevice nozzle, or extension wand installed respectively or collectively in one vacuum cleaner, it meets diverse cleaning needs for hard floors, such as wooden floors and marble, stairs, windowsills, beds, and sofas. 【Proweful Suction】: This vacuum cleaner is equipped with a 400W strong motor, can generate up to 12000Pa powerful suction, perfect for hardwood floors, marble floors, tile, low pile carpet and can easily pick up all kinds of particles like dust, pet hair, pet litter, food scraps, etc. 【Multi-Purpose】: The stick vacuum cleaner is easy to assemble and it has 3 different attachment heads - main floor brush & crevice tool & 2-in-1 brush. There is a button on the main floor brush, you can switch it when cleaning different surfaces such as hard floors or carpeted floors. When convert from a stick vacuum cleaner to a handheld vacuum cleaner, it performs decently on corners, stairs, shelves, and even on your car. 【Easy To Use】: This vacuum is easy to operate. One-click can start the vacuum, no need to keep pressing the switch. The filter is washable and reusable, please leave it dry before refitting. A clean filter helps to maintain the decent suction and efficiency of this powerful vacuum. 【Handheld Vacuum Mode】: It can be quickly switched to a handheld vacuum cleaner which is very suitable for sofas, car, keyboards and gaps. Have one and you will never worry about the whole household cleaning! 【HEPA Filtration】: The powerful motor can absorb particles such as dust and pollen, and the upgraded HEPA filtration system can capture debris and improve air quality. Suitable for households with pets and children. 【Warranty Service】: We guarantee a 1-year warranty service. All replacement parts and accessories are brand new. Our customer service is online 24 hours a day, no worries about after-sales problems!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616r2B7QRjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EFUSVAC","source_asin":"B0C6JK8MBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1134761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6JK8MBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6JK8MBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
