window.products.push({"id":1134869,"name":"SHAKA LOVE Reusable Bamboo Drinking Straw Set 9 Inch | 100% Natural, Biodegradable, Eco, Organic | Cleaning Brush & Cotton Carry Pouch | Juice, Smooth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ai-Xjq8cL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Plastic is a seriously detrimental material, especially when it comes to drinking straws. It is estimated that in United States alone we use over 500 Million plastic straws EVERY DAY and most of them eventually end-up in oceans, polluting water and killing marine life. Hence there is a massive need to shift to an environmentally sustainable solutions and help our environment from this harm which is proving to be fatal for entire eco-system.Join us in the SHAKA LOVE MOVEMENT to #SayNoToPlastic and #LiveEcoFantastic. 10% of ALL Shaka Love profits are donated to environmental caused to help protect our planet!Keeping the same spirit alive we at SHAKA LOVE decided to do our part and we came up with Reusable Bamboo Drinking Straws which will prove to be a game-changer over a period to time. It will help to reduce the burden of plastic straws on our environment. WHY SHAKA LOVE – REUSABLE BAMBOO STRAWS? ✔ Reusable drinking straw made from 100% Organic Bamboo to reduce the burden on environment. ✔ Premium quality bamboo Free from Chemicals are a safe & healthy drinking option ✔ Modern and trendy looking straws to help you relish any drink in style while being environment friendly. ✔ Compact and portable to carry along to use in office, picnics, parties, theater, pool, beach, outdoors, travel. ✔ Washable natural straws include a cleaning brush and are dishwasher safe. ✔ Designed with rounded lip & wide opening for comfort and ease while also being fully compostable and biodegradable We have taken a small step to in this direction and made an effort to give you a good reason and an amazing alternative so you will be still able to enjoy any drink, smoothie or beverage while doing your part for the environment. Click ADD TO CART and purchase this awesome life changing product while supplies last! 🌎","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ai-Xjq8cL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shaka Love","source_asin":"B083F9LJLP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1134869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083F9LJLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083F9LJLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
